it by a significant margin.</p>\n<p>51 seats the first two years\n103 seats the next\n71 seats the next\n81 seats his last two years</p>\n<p>He did get the senate after his first two years, and that eventually led to swing of the house in the 90's but it lagged.</p>\n<p>Reagan had very little ability to do anything without democrat support, so compromises were deemed necessary.</p>\n<p>Yes, he fucked up agreeing/trusting them on immigration</p>\n<p>But he did not intend to be hoodwinked by them, they are just dishonest assholes.</p>\n<p>The whole country swung right because of Reagan, it took time, but it happened.</p>\n<p>Trump is doing the same thing, but it is a slow process....</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 22, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}